title: mf metarecord field get
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Data model]]
kind: reference
summary: Print the field's value(s)

Prints a field's values; `--resolve <field>` follows each `ref` to the referenced metarecord's `<field>` — a position is printed as its path, one line per path for a node of several parents ([[Editing metarecords from the command line]]).
